  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Energy Efficiency and Sustainable Energy in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of development engagement 1 is: &#x201c;Energy Efficiency Building Codes are developed and introduced with the aim of gradual enforcement in Georgia; labelling of energy efficiency levels on products are enforced and in line with European standards; national monitoring and reporting on end-users energy consumption is reformed and in line with EUROSTAT methodologies and legislation on integration of renewable energy into national power system is introduced&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
